; A directive missing an argument it cannot do without is a syntax error on
; its line, and the directive is dropped: a balance without its account or
; with a tolerance but no number, a custom without its type, a document or a
; note without its account, a price without its commodity or its number, and
; a query with a word after its strings.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A

2020-01-02 balance 100.00 USD
2020-01-02 open Assets:B

2020-01-03 balance Assets:A 1 ~ USD
2020-01-03 open Assets:C

2020-01-04 custom 1 USD
2020-01-04 open Assets:D

2020-01-05 document "/tmp/x.pdf"
2020-01-05 open Assets:E

2020-01-06 note "text"
2020-01-06 open Assets:F

2020-01-07 price 1.10 USD
2020-01-07 open Assets:G

2020-01-08 price EUR USD
2020-01-08 open Assets:H

2020-01-09 query "a" "b" junk
2020-01-09 open Assets:I
